# Super-Adaptoid enters targeting Bot2's Phyrexian Dragon Engine (double strike): a double strike counter. On turn 5 it attacks
# and its trigger targets Bot2's Picklock Prankster (flying, vigilance): a flying and a vigilance counter. Unblocked, it deals
# its 1 twice (CR 702.4b). Vigilance came after it was declared as an attacker and tapped (CR 508.1f, 702.20b), so it stays
# tapped that turn; on turn 7 it attacks again with vigilance and stays untapped, and the trigger, targeting the Prankster
# again, adds nothing: it has flying and vigilance. Bot2 takes 2 each time.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Super-Adaptoid
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Picklock Prankster
Phyrexian Dragon Engine
Island x13

